    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="83b4b690-bdd1-5690-81e2-e818bac248a4" activityNameId="452d5bb7-ca66-5ae6-a3e0-1d350fea3528" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electrode, positive, LaNi5, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electrode, positive, LaNi5, at plant
The functional unit represents 1 kg of the positive LaNi5 electrode material for the production of NiMH batteries. Process data is taken mainly from an environmental report of a battery producer as well as from literature. In addition own measurements of sizes and weights of batteries were used.;
UUID: bba5a68c-a2eb-34ee-94aa-5f3ffb278be8
(Raw) materials, transport efforts and energy consumption for the production of the positive electrode for NiMH batteries. Neither waste nor emissions to air or water are taken into account.
Location: This module relates to the global situation (electricity consumption according to the main producing countries).
Technology: Construction details as described for NiMH-rechargable batteries and manufacturing conditions as documented in the environmental report were adopted.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, measurements 
Extrapolations: see technology &amp; general comments
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bba5a68c-a2eb-34ee-94aa-5f3ffb278be8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
